Description: Link private MIDI implementation statically into the application
 The original libmidi is an implementation detail, not an ABI-stable shared
 library. Debian packages must not install liblibmidi.so without a SONAME.
Author: Linthesia - Studio Debian packaging
Forwarded: not-needed
--- a/src/libmidi/meson.build
+++ b/src/libmidi/meson.build
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
-libmidi = library('libmidi',
+libmidi = static_library('libmidi',
                   'MidiEvent.cpp',
                   'MidiTrack.cpp',
                   'Midi.cpp',
                   'MidiUtil.cpp',
-                  install : true)
+                  install : false)
